        "DailyContent": [
          {
            "ID": "Daily01",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "meet_001",
              "SourceString": "初次见面",
              "LocalizedString": "First Meet"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_meet_001",
              "SourceString": "你好，我是达芙蒂尔，浔的保镖……太简单了吗？抱歉，我并不擅长闲聊，有需要请直接咨询「伊波恩」古董店。",
              "LocalizedString": "Hello, I'm Daffodill, Hotori's bodyguard… Too simple? Sorry, small talk isn't my strong suit. If you need anything, just reach out to Eibon, the antique shop."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_meet_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_meet_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily02",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "chat_NPC013_001",
              "SourceString": "闲聊·休息",
              "LocalizedString": "Chat: Rest"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_chat_001",
              "SourceString": "找点事情做做吧，总是闲着的话身体会生锈的。",
              "LocalizedString": "You need to do something. Sitting idle won't do your body any good."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_chat_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_chat_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": [
              {
                "Firendly": 2,
                "QuestId": "None",
                "CharacterFileBreakLevel": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily03",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "chat_NPC013_002",
              "SourceString": "闲聊·武器",
              "LocalizedString": "Chat: Weapons"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_chat_002",
              "SourceString": "再好的武器也需要定期保养才能保持锋利，人也是一样。",
              "LocalizedString": "Even the best weapons need regular maintenance to stay sharp, and so do people."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_chat_002.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_chat_002",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily04",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "chat_NPC013_003",
              "SourceString": "闲聊·欢迎词",
              "LocalizedString": "Chat: Greetings"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_chat_003",
              "SourceString": "亲、亲爱的顾客，欢迎光……光……啧。",
              "LocalizedString": "Dear customer… wel… welcome… Tch."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_chat_003.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_chat_003",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily05",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "weather_001",
              "SourceString": "大晴天",
              "LocalizedString": "Sunny"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_weather_001",
              "SourceString": "好天气，适合户外训练。",
              "LocalizedString": "Good weather. Time for some outdoor training."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily06",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "weather_002",
              "SourceString": "雨天",
              "LocalizedString": "Rainy"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_weather_002",
              "SourceString": "下雨了？利用雨水隐蔽身形和气味的话……",
              "LocalizedString": "It's raining? I can use rain to mask my presence…"
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_002.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_002",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily07",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "weather_003",
              "SourceString": "寒冷",
              "LocalizedString": "Cold"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_weather_003",
              "SourceString": "寒冷会让身体僵硬，麻痹感知……或许这时候，猎物和猎手的身份正适合互换。",
              "LocalizedString": "The cold stiffens the body and numbs the senses… In such a moment, perhaps it's best for the roles of prey and hunter to be reversed."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_003.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_003",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily08",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "weather_004",
              "SourceString": "炎热",
              "LocalizedString": "Hot"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_weather_004",
              "SourceString": "呼……令人讨厌的温度。",
              "LocalizedString": "Argh… this temperature is annoying."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_004.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_weather_004",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily09",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "greet_001",
              "SourceString": "早上问候",
              "LocalizedString": "Morning Greeting"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_greet_001",
              "SourceString": "早上好，今天的安排是什么？",
              "LocalizedString": "Good morning, what's the plan for today?"
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily10",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "greet_002",
              "SourceString": "中午问候",
              "LocalizedString": "Noon Greeting"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_greet_002",
              "SourceString": "困的话可以小憩一会儿，我会叫醒你的。",
              "LocalizedString": "If you're tired, you can take a nap. I'll wake you up."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_002.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_002",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily11",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "greet_003",
              "SourceString": "傍晚问候",
              "LocalizedString": "Evening Greeting"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_greet_003",
              "SourceString": "还能再训练一会儿，要来么？",
              "LocalizedString": "We can train a bit more. Want to join?"
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_003.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_003",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily12",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "greet_004",
              "SourceString": "晚安",
              "LocalizedString": "Good Night"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_greet_004",
              "SourceString": "好好休息吧，夜里的伊波恩，很安全。",
              "LocalizedString": "Rest well, Eibon is safe at night."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_004.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_greet_004",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily13",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "hobby_001",
              "SourceString": "爱好",
              "LocalizedString": "Hobbies"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_hobby_001",
              "SourceString": "谈不上有什么特别喜好，生存需要而已。压缩甜食便于携带又可以提供大量能量，所以我会带上一些以备不时之需。至于口味，那并不重要。",
              "LocalizedString": "I can't say I have any particular preferences, just survival needs. Compressed sweets are easy to carry and provide a lot of energy, so I bring some just in case. How they taste doesn't really matter."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_hobby_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_hobby_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily14",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "vexation_001",
              "SourceString": "烦恼",
              "LocalizedString": "Worries"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_vexation_001",
              "SourceString": "有些客人比异象还要难缠，但是浔说为了伊波恩的生意，一定要保持微笑服务……感觉最近的委托成交率更低了？咳……是你的错觉。",
              "LocalizedString": "Some customers are harder to deal with than anomalies, but Hotori says we should always smile for Eibon's business… Huh? You think our commission success rate has been dropping lately? Ahem… that's absolutely not true."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_vexation_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_vexation_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily15",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "talk_NPC013_001",
              "SourceString": "话题·异象",
              "LocalizedString": "Topic: Anomalies"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_talk_001",
              "SourceString": "真相往往以谎言作为伪装。异象也好，人也好——大多都是表里不一的。光是「看见」远远不够。认知、觉察、剖析。事物像万花筒般从不同视角展开……才能窥见本质。",
              "LocalizedString": "Truth often hides among lies. Both humans and anomalies are not what they seem on the surface. Merely \"seeing\" does not suffice. You must understand, perceive, and analyze. Only when you adopt a kaleidoscope of perspectives… can you fathom truth itself."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_talk_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_talk_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily16",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "talk_NPC013_002",
              "SourceString": "话题·训练",
              "LocalizedString": "Topic: Training"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_talk_002",
              "SourceString": "日复一日的训练算不上枯燥，想要变得更强，总得付出一些代价。只有足够强大，才不会重蹈覆辙。",
              "LocalizedString": "I don't find all the daily training tedious. No pain, no gain, right? The only way to avoid screwing up again is by getting stronger."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_talk_002.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_talk_002",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily17",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "talk_NPC013_003",
              "SourceString": "话题·钓鱼",
              "LocalizedString": "Topic: Fishing"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_talk_003",
              "SourceString": "我观察过那些坐在岸边一整天却毫无收获的钓者，天气，水温，鱼群状态，太多不可控制的因素都会导致失败，但耐心始终是一个好的猎手该具备的品质，鱼桶总会有装满的时候。",
              "LocalizedString": "I've observed those anglers who sit by the shore all day with nothing to show for it. The weather, water temperature, conditions of the fish—so many uncontrollable factors can lead to failure. But patience is always a quality a good hunter should have. Your bucket is going to end up full eventually."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_talk_003.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_talk_003",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily18",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "self_NPC013_001",
              "SourceString": "关于自己·异能",
              "LocalizedString": "About Myself: Esper Abilities"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_self_001",
              "SourceString": "只是用一小部分视力作为交换而已，并不影响日常生活，正相反，有时听见的可比看见的更多。",
              "LocalizedString": "Just a trade with some of my vision, doesn't affect my daily life too much. Sometimes you hear more than you see."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_self_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_self_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily19",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "self_NPC013_002",
              "SourceString": "关于自己·深色",
              "LocalizedString": "About Myself: Dark Colors"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_self_002",
              "SourceString": "总是穿深色的衣服？……并不是什么偏好，只是深色的衣服能掩盖受伤的痕迹，多数时候可以用来欺骗对手。",
              "LocalizedString": "Wondering why I wear dark clothes all the time…? It's not because I like them, but because they do a better job at hiding my injuries and deceiving my enemies."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_self_002.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_self_002",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily20",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "self_NPC013_003",
              "SourceString": "关于自己·名字",
              "LocalizedString": "About Myself: Name"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_self_003",
              "SourceString": "似乎是水仙花的意思。一根枝条上只开一朵，听浔说我家附近的湖心也长着一朵，但我并未见过。如果可以的话，希望你还是喊我「达芙蒂尔」，而不是……嗯。",
              "LocalizedString": "It seems to mean \"narcissus.\" Only one flower blooms on each stem. Hotori told me there's one in the lake near my place, though I've never seen it. If possible, I'd prefer you to call me Daffodill instead of…ahem."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_self_003.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_self_003",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily21",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "about_NPC009_001",
              "SourceString": "关于浔·担忧",
              "LocalizedString": "About Hotori: Concerns"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_about_001",
              "SourceString": "有时候浔的做法过于大胆了，总是以身涉险，就好像只要能达成想要的结果，什么都无所谓，呼……是我还不够强。",
              "LocalizedString": "I know Hotori will do whatever it takes to get what she wants, putting herself at risk along the way. But sometimes the way she goes about it is a bit over-the-top… Well, I guess I do have some catching up to do."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_001.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_001",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily22",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "about_NPC009_002",
              "SourceString": "关于浔·初遇",
              "LocalizedString": "About Hotori: First Meeting"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_about_002",
              "SourceString": "初遇时就醉醺醺的，那时只觉得是个奇怪的女人。但不知为何……莫名有种安心与信任感。这也是为什么我会在这吧。",
              "LocalizedString": "She was drunk when we first met. I just thought she was a strange woman. But for some reason… her presence was comforting and I trusted her. I guess that explains why I'm here now."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_002.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_002",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily23",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "about_NPC011",
              "SourceString": "关于娜娜莉",
              "LocalizedString": "About Nanally"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_about_003",
              "SourceString": "那孩子总是在我训练的时候偷偷观察，就算被发现了过一会儿又会藏到另一个地方继续看……算了，只要不妨碍我，就随她吧。",
              "LocalizedString": "That kid's always peeking at me when I train. I've caught her a few times, but she just finds another spot and keeps at it… Well, as long as she doesn't get in my way, I guess."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_003.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_003",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily24",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "about_NPC022",
              "SourceString": "关于残虹",
              "LocalizedString": "About Zankou"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_about_004",
              "SourceString": "很危险，如非必要，不要和她有任何接触。",
              "LocalizedString": "She's very dangerous. Avoid any contact with her unless necessary."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_004.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_004",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily25",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "about_NPC010",
              "SourceString": "关于阿德勒",
              "LocalizedString": "About Adler"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_about_005",
              "SourceString": "阿德勒先生是非常值得尊敬的人，在我遇到浔之前，是他一直陪伴着浔，我还有很多方面要向他学习。",
              "LocalizedString": "Adler is a very respectable person. Before I met Hotori, he was always by her side. I have a lot to learn from him."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_005.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_005",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily26",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "about_Eibon",
              "SourceString": "关于伊波恩古董店",
              "LocalizedString": "About Eibon Antique Shop"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_about_006",
              "SourceString": "伊波恩与我过去所待的地方完全不同。在这里要为了生计去接待难搞的顾客，就连同伴也整天吵吵闹闹……但是……至少在伊波恩里可以睡个安稳觉。",
              "LocalizedString": "Eibon is completely different from where I used to be. Here, you have to deal with difficult customers for a living, and your friends here are noisy all the time… but I can sleep here without worrying about anything at least."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
              "AssetPathName": "/Game/WwiseAudio/Events/Voice/Char/NPC013/Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_006.Play_Vo_Char_NPC013_about_006",
              "SubPathString": ""
            },
            "Conditions": []
          },
          {
            "ID": "Daily27",
            "Title": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "ug_001",
              "SourceString": "角色突破·Ⅰ",
              "LocalizedString": "Character Ascension I"
            },
            "Content": {
              "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_File.ST_File",
              "Key": "NPC013_ug_001",
              "SourceString": "汗水的收获。",
              "LocalizedString": "Hard work pays off."
            },
            "AudioEvent": {
